      "source": "A <a href=\"ResourceResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.servlet.resource\"><code>ResourceResolver</code></a> that\nresolves resources from a <a href=\"../../../cache/Cache.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache</code></a> or otherwise\ndelegates to the resolver chain and saves the result in the cache.",
